            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Effective upon ratification of this Agreement, an employee shall be paid a differential of fifty cents ($0.50) per hour for all hours of any shift which starts between the hours of 12:00 noon and 3:00 a.m. A major portion of an hour is a period of thirty (30) minutes or greater.",
            "block_bbox": [
